      "text": "function drain() {\n    if (!active && queueStop.length) {\n      var a = queueStop.shift();\n      render(a.kind, a.request, a.displayKind);\n    }\n    if (!activeNS && queueNS.length) {\n      var b = queueNS.shift();\n      renderNonStop(b.kind, b.request, b.displayKind);\n    }\n  }\n\n",
